#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:2
msgid "Kubernetes Blueprints"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| allows you to store Kubernetes configuration YAML files for "
"easy deployment on-demand. Kubernetes Blueprints can be built by pulling "
"in Kubernetes spec stored as a |morpheus| Spec Template object, those "
"tracked under version control in a Git repository, or you can write them "
"directly in the New Blueprint modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:6
msgid ""
"To create a new Kubernetes Blueprint, navigate to |LibBluApp|. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:8
msgid ""
"On the Name tab of the New Blueprint modal, enter a name for your new "
"Blueprint. In the Type dropdown menu, select Kubernetes. :guilabel:`NEXT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:10
msgid "In the Cluster Summary section, complete the following fields as needed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:12
msgid ""
"**NAME:** Enter a name for this Blueprint as it will appear in the "
"|morpheus| Blueprints list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:13
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description field for your Blueprint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:14
msgid ""
"**CATEGORY:** An optional category tag for your Blueprint, such as web, "
"utility, or app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:15
msgid ""
"**IMAGE:** An optional image icon to more easily identify your Blueprint "
"from a list. If no image is uploaded, a default image will be used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:17
msgid ""
"Complete the Kubernetes Configuration section as follows depending on "
"your Config Type selection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:19
msgid "To consume a |morpheus| Spec Template containing Kubernetes spec:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:21
msgid "**CONFIG TYPE:** \"Kubernetes Spec\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:22
msgid ""
"**SPEC TEMPLATE:** Use the typeahead field to locate the desired Spec "
"Template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:24
msgid "To draft or paste configuration directly in the New Blueprint modal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:26
msgid "**CONFIG TYPE:** \"Kubernetes Yaml Spec\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:27
msgid "**CONFIG:** Enter your YAML configuration template here"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:29
msgid "To consume YAML configuration files tracked in a Git repository:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:31
msgid "**CONFIG TYPE:** \"Git Repository\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:32
msgid ""
"**SCM INTEGRATION:** If a pre-existing SCM integration is selected here, "
"the available selections in the \"Repository\" dropdown menu will be "
"filtered to show only those associated with the chosen SCM integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:33
msgid "**REPOSITORY:** Select the repository in which your configuration resides"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:34
msgid "**BRANCH OR TAG:** The branch in which your configuration resides"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:35
msgid "**WORKING PATH:** The path to your configuration files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:36
msgid "**CONFIG:** Your selected config file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:38
msgid "Once finished, click :guilabel:`COMPLETE`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/appBlueprints/kubernetes.rst:40
msgid ""
"Your new Kubernetes Blueprint is now saved and should be visible in the "
"list of Blueprints. Blueprints are deployed in the |ProApp| section of "
"|morpheus|. See the Apps section of |morpheus| docs for more information "
"on that process."
msgstr ""

